# Near-surface smoke (ug/m^3) — transparent in clean air, hazy gray-yellow
# for light smoke, through orange/red to purple for dense plumes.
# interpolate_color: plumes are continuous, bins would band them.
nv    0   0   0   0
1     255 255 255 0
4     200 200 190 40
8     230 220 130 80
15    240 200 80  120
25    245 170 50  150
40    245 140 40  175
60    240 100 35  200
90    230 60  30  220
140   200 30  25  235
200   150 20  60  245
300   110 30  110 255
